{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：18:30 2026-10-17 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"璀璨之城丨陳瀅全裸「腿張開」收25宗投訴  張智霖自爆全家睇激戰陳曉華：外父外母一齊睇\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/edfc787083a9da5029458bd1513a86be/2026-10/20261017_ENT_ENT___2.png\"/>\n<p>TVB台慶劇《璀璨之城》熱播中，剛播出一周即掀起話題。張智霖（Chilam）於劇中演富家子官孝賢，分別與陳曉華及陳瀅有情慾戲。張智霖近日接受TVB娛樂新聞台訪問，被問到與陳曉華拍激情戲的感想，他笑言作為專業演員，太太袁詠儀（靚靚）並無陪同「試戲」，但就有全家總動員一同觀看：「有呀，一齊睇，刺激嘛！拍嘅時候已經好刺激，睇嘅時候都好刺激㗎嘛。我覺得我緊張啲，成家人，外父外母……一齊睇，嘩！好好睇呀！」張智霖更生動地描述觀後反應：「好似都有一聲……倒抽一口涼氣嘅聲音，一完咗……（深呼吸）……全家人！」他形容情慾戲過後，全家氣氛反而「好歡樂」。</p>\n<h2>陳瀅「腿張開」掀全城熱話</h2>\n<p>日前張智霖與陳瀅的大尺度戲碼引起全城熱話，陳瀅飾演的記者霍佩樺，為向張智霖飾演的官孝賢展現結盟決心，上演了一幕演藝生涯最裸露的戲份。劇情講述她接連脫去外衣及內衣，以鏡頭交代全裸，更打開雙腿讓張智霖拍照，畫面意識相當大膽。陳瀅為此角色花了九個月時間操練身形，敬業精神獲網民讚賞，不少人稱讚她身材好，認為劇情有突破才能展現角色決心。</p>\n<img alt=\"TVB台慶劇《璀璨之城》熱播中，剛播出一周即掀起話題。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9c394c256cba97a6e996cfe69e9c656a/2026-10/09_0_16.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張智霖與多名女角有感情線。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3f6d6dd7eacd621ed4a8d648883fbdf4/2026-10/17_2_13.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"官孝賢（張智霖飾）好有艷福。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/590c9febf1eb2233a5800c8c136f1473/2026-10/25_11.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張智霖近日接受TVB娛樂新聞台訪問，被問到與陳曉華拍激情戲的感想，他笑言作為專業演員，太太袁詠儀（靚靚）並無陪同「試戲」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4aade4276509ef2001824d95d534f399/2026-10/VS--YouTube--YouTube-1_23_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"但就有全家總動員一同觀看：「有呀，一齊睇，刺激嘛！拍嘅時候已經好刺激，睇嘅時候都好刺激㗎嘛。我覺得我緊張啲，成家人，外父外母……一齊睇，嘩！好好睇呀！」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/90c04759af23a760b0a431802754da67/2026-10/VS--YouTube--YouTube-2_12_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張智霖更生動地描述觀後反應：「好似都有一聲……倒抽一口涼氣嘅聲音，一完咗……（深呼吸）……全家人！」他形容情慾戲過後，全家氣氛反而「好歡樂」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a0abcc1eb2f7c8a12477ad76eef7a76d/2026-10/VS--YouTube--YouTube-1_28_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"官孝賢（張智霖飾）首集即與郭芷媛（陳曉華飾）激烈擁吻。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/14846d6c826ce6245c6bb8052a23a080/2026-10/VS--1--myTVSUPER-14_38_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"官孝賢（張智霖飾）的手更從女方腰間游走。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ddb818096cc437eedf20a637c9770076/2026-10/VS--1--myTVSUPER-14_48_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"甚至伸入裙內。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ad716321577daae033c6bde0a6effa3b/2026-10/VS--1--myTVSUPER-14_49_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"郭芷媛（陳曉華飾）狀甚享受。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8cc0369563305eee71c83dfa8904d81a/2026-10/VS--1--myTVSUPER-14_53_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"角度相當曖昧。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ead3c425881cb850ebb64a689ec42afa/2026-10/VS--1--myTVSUPER-15_01_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"官孝賢（張智霖飾）與郭芷媛（陳曉華飾）雖然穿得密實，但二人互動卻相當有Feel。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/669cf6df9fe406411b87c8f9dc0f0acd/2026-10/VS--1--myTVSUPER-15_11_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳曉華看上去極有袁詠儀年青時的樣子。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7187adb60b5323715177787a839ab7a5/2026-10/VS--1--myTVSUPER-15_38_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳曉華將存有黑材料的手機寄給陳瀅，疑心極重的張智霖得悉後試探陳瀅。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/341866effee24201dd854df523ecad98/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-18_37_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅為了與張智霖達成利益交易，見面時先交出手機。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9de424f6f6c84f9891313000cd918532/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-39_07_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅主動上演一幕極致大膽的「全裸誘惑」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/83743d39e7bdff9a3ca23bbdcf29ea5a/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-40_20_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅主動除衫。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ec2a0bf2664d3da794b445574fb1d008/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-40_34_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅先露出黑bra。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/069c4b785d8fff50b28620a68d4e9886/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-40_39_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅再除下牛仔褲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c0a860436763614915049fcb334c21cf/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-40_42_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅露出蜜桃臀。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b60bf2304a1174ede90d77d2272bf24f/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-40_43_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張智霖一臉嫌棄。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d0a392d28d7c5b83b89ec34e6d6353ea/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-40_56_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅繼續出招。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/af8eec1a8833823d1ededd8c650d96d9/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-41_01_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張智霖冷眼看陳瀅下一步行動。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c1c10c13a7b96c17a14dcbb4ad8b6ee0/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-41_10_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅準備坐在床上。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cecd73e938289986dabac79ba39a60f3/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-41_11_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅準備除下內褲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8149e85dc649e4f12896e9152e9fd23f/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-41_12_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"意識相當大膽。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d29a5dfd593bded778b4c5d294d82103/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-41_17_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅解開胸罩背扣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f4b85d35644c9fbb3f1b10702f44edce/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-41_21_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅大晒玉背。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ccb8f8e39a22a94262b1e4541a6ac078/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-41_23_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅盡騷一流身材。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/788683d4835a23c8b9991bcb0bc64722/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-41_24_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅即將一絲不掛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f6c2e91f929731a4b6aee6e1e55d2f7f/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-41_26_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅將身上衣物全數脫光。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/aca8a442d4b89f2bc87ddb838be0aa61/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-41_29_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅躺在床上腿張開。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/adefb06c8d8aaa2aa0d4695f5ba845b2/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-41_32_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅任影唔嬲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7bfaf8f92d5af7d2835c6620e6a2455c/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-41_57_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"首次挑戰大膽除衫戲，陳瀅坦言現場緊張萬分。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/583bea3e5581a451cd8e3929fb751ac0/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-42_01_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅又稱收到劇本已經很喜歡這場。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cca90a71763a069064ec774e63063377/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-42_05_.jpg\"/>\n<h2>《璀璨之城》被質疑尺度過大收投訴</h2>\n<p>然而，該場大膽戲份在網上引起激烈爭議，不少觀眾認為尺度過大，不適合在黃金時段播出，擔心對一同觀看的小朋友造成不良影響。據悉，通訊事務管理局至今已接獲28宗相關投訴，其中25宗針對第4集內容，局方表示現正按既定程序處理。</p>\n<h2>張智霖兒子張慕童神顏再進化？</h2>\n<img alt=\"張慕童自小已長得很俊俏。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d5613453371bf37b24597080aa68caf9/2024-04/yuanyongyierzizheyanzhiyihouhuichudaoba_12_yangleyiduoduo_laizixiaohongshuwangyeban.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張慕童樣貌似足袁詠儀拍《金枝玉葉》時。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e4837626287e5a87c67a0f4c28477538/2024-04/403.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁詠儀55歲生日收「最美鮮花」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/540f99c87ce5c891d4678e21b3e7761b/2026-09/001_1_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張智霖身穿全白西裝大展歌喉，舞台王者氣場十足。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/70697d339d7b0b436ec911fb92399eba/2026-09/001mSeVfgy1iha7aqjxpaj60zk1hcdil02.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張智霖換上紫色風衣配搭墨鏡型格開唱，散發熟男魅力。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/74b4bb2a9009815e3225440b46e6509e/2026-09/001mSeVfgy1iha7ar3r3fj60zk1hcn3a02.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張智霖席地深情獻唱，沉浸在音樂之中。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/59201049b8fb047952975a9b36961194/2026-09/001mSeVfgy1iha7ark1g2j60zk1hc47802.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張智霖穿上粉色亮片外套帶動全場氣氛，狀態大勇。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5a3cc19340fdfd63a0b94a0daccadeb1/2026-09/001mSeVfgy1iha7auy0c0j60zk1hc7cd02.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張智霖在台上熱力開唱，引爆上海站氣氛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/83dc02d666a1ff6ea66f35a6374c862e/2026-09/VS--monica-rednote-0_50_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁詠儀在看台興奮舉起手機狂拍，記錄老公與兒子的高光時刻。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dba7b06d8b55cf4d9a61dd292e60d685/2026-09/VS--monica-rednote-1_14_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"19歲魔童（張慕童）抱著結他亮相，立體五官被讚完美繼承父母神基因。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6e839370d85d8d88df7d28c15ba44c14/2026-09/VS---rednote-0_05__2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"魔童低頭專注彈奏，神情認真，外貌極似媽咪袁詠儀。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/96f926445a84e42544afcce2222416a6/2026-09/VS---rednote-0_07__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"演出結束後魔童笑容燦爛向觀眾揮手致意，星味十足。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/152984cace1d2bf2820c3d9fef2c574a/2026-09/VS---rednote-0_10__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁詠儀在台下默默守候，低調裝扮掩蓋不住專注的慈母眼神。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/775baeed28d2d751a25bfee48e8e8e4a/2026-09/_2_Mirita__.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張慕童坐於樂隊席整裝待發，台風沉穩淡定。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2fa992c7773de45135e27fea33890e42/2026-09/_1_____18.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張慕童與父母一樣是「顏值天花板」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ab2c04fad3240c8fc267023de5139fdd/2026-09/_2_____0_8.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張智霖早前在廣州舉行一連兩場演唱會。　\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6242b972cffe2a796cbdf154a7b4a47d/2026-08/cheung_17_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁詠儀的19歲兒子「魔童」張慕童登上爸爸張智霖的演唱會舞台。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5279d008e69dfcb6e3a4ef078a78c261/2026-08/cheung_1_.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T12:58:53.819745+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":617,"images":53,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T10:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T20:37:49.275579+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T12:57:41.003112+00:00","content_hash":"09522bde4044e34feee813e55c500545b7598d530d28941a133ff2e5194f422f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}